# Headless tour of controls (cargo xtask sim-smoke): drag the slider (the bar, the dial and the
# label follow), click the switch (the checkbox, the LED and the power button follow), move the
# keypad focus three times and press Enter on the focused control, then scroll down.
wait 300
shot initial
drag 48 52 70 52 300
wait 400
shot slider_dragged
tap 43 206
wait 300
shot switch_on
key Next
key Next
key Next
wait 50
key Enter
wait 400
shot keypad
drag 160 220 160 80 300
wait 600
shot scrolled
